---
description: Tervory house rules for every task in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md at the repo root before changing anything. The short version:
- Never push to main (it deploys to production). Branch `cursor/<task-id>-<slug>`, open a PR, stop.
- No secrets in code. New env vars: name only, in .env.example.
- Every Tank query is scoped by tenant_id. The Workspace reaches models only via Tank, server-side, through workspace/lib/tank.ts.
- Schema changes additive and idempotent only.
- Only edit the files your task brief (docs/cursor/<task>.md) allows.
- Use the official logo files in workspace/public/brand/; never redraw the logo.
